{"availability":"available","full":"dansday-com/dansday-discord-bot","name":"dansday-discord-bot","description":"DANSDAY — from dev to community. A free, open-source Discord bot built by developers and shaped by its communities: leveling, an XP economy where members steal each other's XP, moderation, giveaways and creator alerts, with no premium tier. A MEE6 alternative you can self-host (AGPL-3.0) or add hosted.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-08-25T19:35:55Z","updated":"2026-10-07T18:33:34Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://dansday.dev","topics":["ai","dansday","discord","discord-bot","discord-bot-dashboard","discord-js","discord-leveling-bot","discord-moderation-bot","fromdevtocommunity","gemini","leveling","leveling-bot","mee6-alternative","open-source","self-hosted","self-hosted-discord-bot","svelte","sveltekit","typescript","voice-assistant"],"demo":"https://dansday.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:28.775Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:28.775Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:28.775Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T18:19:25.892Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T18:42:28.775Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js","Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["From dev to community. A free, open-source Discord bot, built by developers and shaped by the communities that use it — where members steal, shield and spend each other's XP.","Leveling, role rewards, welcome messages, moderation, giveaways and YouTube, Twitch and TikTok alerts, with no premium tier. On top of that: XP that members steal and defend, per-member Roblox price alerts, AI chat and voice that answer from your server's own numbers, personal daily tasks and 70 animated card themes. Configured in a browser. Self-host it or add the hosted bot."],"features":["Account page - The Account button in the Discord menu opens the member's own page. XP sources, a 14-day XP flow, voice buddies, bag, tasks, portfolio, minigames and history. No signup, no password.","Member themes - Each member sets a background image and an accent colour read from it, then spins 1,000 XP for an animated effect. It repaints their account, cards, their leaderboard row and their members-list card.","Public - Master switch for server statistics, leaderboard, members and the member account. Items, Minigames, Market, Daily tasks and Server invite are sub-toggles, all on by default. The server join page takes its own…","Items & XP economy - Per-server shop priced in XP, 50-slot bag, optional timed availability. Effects: 💰 steal, 💥 bomb, 🩸 leech, 🎯 bounty, 🛡️ shield, 🪞 reflect, 💵 insurance, ⚡ boost, 🎁 gift, 🔍 spy, 🎭 disguise,…","🍀 Luck raises steal and bomb rolls, minigame odds, spy success, leech skim, friend boost and insurance refund, cuts gift tax and discounts prices. Timed buffs lock luck in on activation, so use luck first."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dansday-com/dansday-discord-bot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"991aa32da882584fc807f81ca57a680a06286d6cf0bc5c99fc06bcb198555573","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T18:44:11.342Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:44:11.342Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"From dev to community. A free, open-source Discord bot, built by developers and shaped by the communities that use it — where members steal, shield and spend each other's XP.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dansday-com/dansday-discord-bot/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-host it or add the hosted bot.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dansday-com/dansday-discord-bot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Live demo · Docs · Self-host · Discord · Contributing","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dansday-com/dansday-discord-bot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Mul